WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Import your subtitles
Four fictional cues. Two translation batches.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Take the prompt to your AI
Stable IDs link every reply to its original subtitle.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Bring the JSON back
Import a saved AI-authored reply. The tool makes no model calls.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A missing cue is blocked
One ID was deliberately removed. Validation rejects this batch.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
One batch is not enough
First batch accepted. Export stays locked at 1 / 2.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Every batch must pass
Both batches accepted. Original timing is retained.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Download the result
Save the translated SRT. Review it in your media player.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Try CueBridge
Open the free browser tool. Start with its built-in sample.
